summary:
  The header's window button sends the face to the window and never home.

history:
  The same button stands in both seats and flips the wish. In the window
  it is the one control inside the face that brings it back to the panel.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
              onMoveAsked: playerWindow.detached = !playerWindow.detached

replace:
              onMoveAsked: playerWindow.detached = true

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_headers_corner_moves_the_face_and_keeps_the_pin.
  Line-neutral.
